{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的段落要点缺少X那样的高亮视觉锚点，音乐细节和身体感受的细腻程度也不如X。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边扫的普通观众，Y的左右分区更容易形成稳定的阅读习惯，叙事和感受可以分别获取，尤其S08、S11等短停留段，不容易被大量感受词拖住。Y的完整叙述也更自然地交代了舍不得、受过委屈、害怕孤单和不愿回头之间的因果关系，前后更像一个连续的人生经历。X的高亮关键词和音乐细节确实更出色，但部分短段的信息密度过高，实际观看时未必来得及消化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0614d505-d7a5-4e92-8e5e-59cc62510a63", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T172819915192Z", "elapsed_seconds": 91.594, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T17:29:51.533673+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "073bb93d22b73772e6f0ed3c783e15e6b0f88bf92846f3c3a46156984192ac15", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "e